# The API image (docker/Dockerfile) copies only these paths, so the build context
# is an allowlist: everything else stays out, whatever lands in the tree later.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!alembic.ini
!src
!api
!migrations

# Local leftovers inside the allowed directories. The `**/` form matches at any
# depth; a bare pattern would match only at the context root.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.env*

# The READMEs under api/ and src/ are documentation; only the root one is read
# by the build (pyproject.toml names it as the package readme).
**/*.md
!README.md
